  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">U.S. Environmental Protection Agency, Office of Air and Radiation (OAR): Montreal Protocol on Substances that deplete the Ozone Layer [Multilateral Fund]</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under the Montreal Protocol on Substances that Deplete the Ozone Layer, the U.S. and other developed countries contribute to the Multilateral Fund to support projects and activities that eliminate the production and use of ozone depleting substances (ODS) in developing countries.</narrative>
  </description>
